represented by the Index. Investors will receive a positive return on investment
only if the price of raw materials increases at a rate that exceeds the cost of
inflation and the management, subscription and other fees involved. Given the
highly unpredictable and volatile nature of futures prices, the price movements
of the raw materials comprising Index should be viewed over a longer period of
time. Beeland Management believes that investors should view their investments
as at least a two-year commitment.

